#, fuzzy
msgid "Funqy HTTP Binding with Google Cloud Functions"
msgstr "Funqy 与 Google Cloud Functions 的 HTTP 绑定"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you want to allow HTTP clients to invoke your Funqy functions on Google Cloud Functions, Quarkus allows you to expose multiple\n"
"Funqy functions through HTTP deployed as one Google Cloud Function.  This approach does add overhead over the\n"
"regular Funqy Google Cloud Function integration."
msgstr "如果您希望允许 HTTP 客户端调用您在 Google Cloud Functions 上部署的 Funqy 函数，Quarkus 支持您将多个 Funqy 函数通过 HTTP 对外暴露，并将其作为单个 Google Cloud Function 进行部署。与常规的 Funqy 和 Google Cloud Functions 集成相比，这种方法确实会增加一些开销。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Follow the xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions Http Guide].  It walks through using a variety of HTTP\n"
"frameworks on Google Cloud Functions, including Funqy."
msgstr "请参考《 xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP 指南] 》。该指南详细介绍了如何在 Google Cloud Functions 上使用各种 HTTP 框架，包括 Funqy。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "An additional Quickstart"
msgstr "另一份快速入门指南"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Beyond generating a Google Cloud Functions project that is covered in the xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP Guide],\n"
"there's also a quickstart for running Funqy HTTP on Google Cloud Functions."
msgstr "除了《 xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP 指南] 》中介绍的创建 Google Cloud Functions 项目外，还有一份关于在 Google Cloud Functions 上运行 Funqy HTTP 的快速入门指南。"

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` ，或下载一个 {quickstarts-archive-url}[存档] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The solution is located in the `funqy-google-cloud-functions-http-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-google-cloud-functions-http-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr "解决方案位于 `funqy-google-cloud-functions-http-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-google-cloud-functions-http-quickstart[目录]。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The Code"
msgstr "《守则》"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is nothing special about the code and more importantly nothing Google Cloud specific.  Funqy functions can be deployed to many\n"
"environments and Google Cloud Functions is one of them.  The Java code is actually the same exact code as the {quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-http-quickstart[funqy-http-quickstart]."
msgstr "代码并无特别之处，更重要的是，它并不针对 Google Cloud。Funqy 函数可以部署到许多环境中，谷歌云函数就是其中之一。Java 代码实际上与 {quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-http-quickstart[funqy-http-quickstart] 的代码完全相同。"

msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The steps to get this quickstart running are exactly the same as defined in the xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP Guide].\n"
"These differences are that you are running from a quickstart and the Maven dependencies are slightly different."
msgstr "运行此快速入门指南的步骤与《 xref:gcp-functions-http.adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP 指南] 》中所述完全一致。区别仅在于您是从快速入门指南开始运行的，且 Maven 依赖项略有不同。"
